  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "claim_2098fbdeb1bd405ebe2ee890ce0997dd",
      "statement": "The decision core consumes a `celld_logic::Config` with `max_resident`, `max_activations`, `max_evictions`, `max_releases`, `max_outbound_websockets`, `ownership_on_evict`, `require_node_lease`, `peer_protocol`, `operation_deadline_ms`, `alarm_resident_ms`, `idle_evict_ms`, and `pressure`.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://crates/logic/types.rs#L63-L136",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:39098968ec504569a5b2675569cd90d482061ac968a484f9d6e7ce31f944e103:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_f624f77da70b4d1ab160d923a216802a",
      "statement": "The maximum resident cells is optional; with no value the node has no resident ceiling (defaults to usize::MAX), because the prototype's original default of eight introduced eviction churn in unconstrained workloads.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://crates/celld/main.rs#L3166-L3171",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:e82ad0155a9c18b7bc1345740ee24370344bce01bdc70b3f4985fafae525c187:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_31f31cab095b4e4ca0e1eee7f053b228",
      "statement": "`CELLD_ACTIVATIONS` bounds how many complete nonresident cold routes may be in flight at once and defaults to available parallelism capped by `DEFAULT_MAX_CONCURRENT_ACTIVATIONS`.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://crates/celld/main.rs#L3271-L3277",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:1738162b8e50ec64e73e2adff2fd052cdc9d81deb1b9a603b9e45840a938b88a:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_7299952fade743d6a698c9906806013b",
      "statement": "`CELLD_EVICTIONS` bounds evictions holding a durability proof in flight and `CELLD_RELEASES` bounds complete cell handoffs in flight during shutdown; each has a documented default.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://crates/celld/main.rs#L3278-L3281",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:41424544be1e0472c4291415bf9bcc20396f788808d8996d60d12ca5cac01591:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://crates/logic/types.rs#L74-L87",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:4399fae98d44a8d53d81c53be858fff2b3865cfbc802856ccd18e99ae34dc80c:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_76d3d533743349718f86807fc7bcc9b3",
      "statement": "Memory-pressure shedding is configured through `PressureConfig` with `high_bytes` and `rss_hard_bytes`; `PressureConfig::from_limits` builds the watermarks from total memory and `CELLD_MAX_RSS_MB`, and a value at or above the absolute cap makes the cap the effective limit with a warning.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://crates/celld/machine.rs#L110-L128",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:977ff61b7ce67ffaf6c9353305c033373b4e696036056466f862cda7f0774119:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://crates/logic/pressure.rs#L19-L44",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:4eaf3c8a3da102c710f8f4faea5fc5e8e5aecaea2a2b51c7ad434f595ec72ab5:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_66d21445c0394c0e8aa51339b52c692a",
      "statement": "`CELLD_V8_HEAP_LIMIT_MB` defaults to 128 MB and is validated in env_vars.rs, which rejects a value whose byte count overflows; the limit decides how many hibernatable WebSocket clients a cell can carry.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://crates/celld/env_vars.rs#L82-L86",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:8a50e4e3c069d424d23ded90d61f74bcbfe93b5e421b451e8aab600fa5411430:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_248d42f424ae47c5834ad4d89be7d441",
      "statement": "`CELLD_OPERATION_DEADLINE_MS` (default 15000) bounds a single outstanding activation effect in the actor.",
      "evidence": [
