    {
      "id": "claim_2f0cf4d6df5a4c258c0683987e61f5ec",
      "statement": "`Cargo.toml` defines a `release` profile (fat LTO, codegen-units 1, opt-level s, panic abort, strip) and a `lab` profile (thin LTO, codegen-units 16, incremental, strip false, line-tables-only) so shipped artifacts stay on release while the lab image keeps symbols for perf.",
